Two Agents pointed to commit _691644eee_ as being the root cause.  To confirm,  explicitly overrode the User-Agent: addition and restore 1.3.0's behavior.  **This fixed the problem.**

```json
{
  "providers": [
    {
      "id": "ollama",
      "api": "http://localhost:11434/v1",
      "models": {
        "llama3": {
          "id": "llama3",
          // THIS IS THE FIX BELOW
          "headers": {
            "User-Agent": ""
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Set "User-Agent": "" to send no User-Agent (mimicking v1.3.0), or set it to whatever value your local server expects.

